  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/yehi_ratzon">
          <tei:div>
            <tei:p>May it be thy will, Lord our God and God of our fathers, that the Temple be speedily rebuilt in our days, and grant us a share in thy Torah. There we will serve thee with reverence, as in the<tei:pb n="98" ed="1949 chol/shacharit/amidah" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n122_medium.jpg"/> days of old and as in former years. Then the offering of Judah and Jerusalem will be pleasing to the Lord, as in the days of old and as in former years.</tei:p>
          </tei:div>
        </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
